{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o049a","title":"诏议狱缓死许亲属乞恩与案俱上","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o049a-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"诏议狱缓死许亲属乞恩与案俱上","evidence":["mingdi-e-o049a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"下诏","evidence":["mingdi-e-o049a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":236,"label":"青龙四年六月壬申","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y236","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o047","basis":"青龙四年六月壬申"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o049a-q","mingdi-q-o047","mingdi-q-b-db98a4e649248abddd22"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o049a-q","source_order":[3,326,"O049a"],"order":899}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o049a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-87afb78bb7f3ffbd871d","layer":"original","quote":"六月，壬申〖6〗，诏曰：“有虞氏画象而民弗犯〖7〗，周人刑措而不用〖8〗。朕从百王之末〖9〗，追望上世之风〖10〗，邈乎何相去之远？法令滋彰〖11〗，犯者弥多；刑罚愈众，而奸不可止。往者按大辟之条，多所蠲除〖12〗；思济生民之命〖13〗，此朕之至意也。而郡国蔽狱〖14〗，一岁之中尚过数百。岂朕训导不醇〖15〗，俾民轻罪〖16〗？将苛法犹存，为之陷阱乎？有司其议狱缓死〖17〗，务从宽简。及乞恩者〖18〗，或辞未出而狱已报断〖19〗，非所以究理尽情也。其令廷尉及天下狱官：诸有死罪，具狱以定〖20〗；非谋反及手杀人，亟语其亲治〖21〗；有乞恩者，使与奏当文书俱上〖22〗，朕将思所以全之〖23〗。其布告天下，使明朕意。”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":310,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-db98a4e649248abddd22","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-db98a4e649248abddd22","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：青龙四年（公元 236）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":329,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d83d6310334c8a05e929","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o047","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7702b97eccbdd8bf0da6","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，太白复昼现；月犯太白，又犯轩辕一星，入太微而出。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
